@startuml
loop until exit
  "agent starling"->"LB controller": What is your latest revision for me?
  "LB controller"->"agent starling": Here is the latest revision
  alt revision is the same as the node's one
    "agent starling"->"agent starling": Goes back to the start of the loop
  else
    "agent starling"->"LB controller": Give me the diff between my revision and the new one
    "agent starling"->"IPVS": Deletes/adds/updates the vips
    "agent starling"->"agent starling": Updates its healthchecks
    Envoy->"agent starling": fetches the info of the new version and updates itself
    "agent starling"->"agent starling": Goes back to the start of the loop
  end
end
@enduml
